s about accessibility for elderly residents have been raised, prompting discussions on design modifications.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/thiruvananthapuram-karimadom-colony-housing-project-gets-dac-nod/134911630?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-302030/134911630.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}